# Manifold level 10
# The fortress's courtyard (stage 5m, from 5f's): the second level. A stable in its middle, a passage
# through it (dark), and a guard going round it; one walking the east side by the well's lantern; one at
# its post by the barracks door, facing the yard (from behind, a blow takes it down). In the north-west
# corner a deck a meter up, a ramp to it: from there the yard is seen, and a scroll waits. Another in the
# stable. Past the door, the barracks' hall: the way out. Drawn as a plan (plans/level-2.plan).
title The courtyard
spawn 0 1 1
facing 0 0 -1
ambient 0.12
sky 22.0

